{
  "id": "c5-l33-tag-suffix-zhcn",
  "scope": "zh_CN fix round 2 (user-reported). (1) Word-order unification: render_tag_mods() tag_postfix changed from leading-space ' 的攻击技能' to gapless '的攻击技能' so new stat-first templates read naturally (e.g. '寒冷伤害的攻击技能提高 12%'). (2) Missing Reduced/Less translations in render_passive_stat_line (962/967) and render_item_stat_line (1021/1026) -> 减少/更少, matching the new stat-first word order. (3) Search box IME support: OS.set_ime_active/position on focus enter/exit in PassiveTreePopup.gd, enable context_menu in PassiveTreePopup.tscn, fix 2-char min length for CJK in PassiveNode.gd, strip spaces in Globals.gd update_search. (4) render_formatted_number FLAT positive sign '+' (976) for added-damage clarity.",
  "patch_type": "CODE_PATCH",
